# <%= it.name %>

<% if (it.description) { %><%= it.description %><% } else { %>A full-featured game built with the DownDraft Engine.<% } %>

## Getting Started

```bash
# Install dependencies
bun install

# Start dev server (includes DevTools panel)
npm run dev

# Build for production
npm run build

# Export for distribution
npm run export
```

## Project Structure

```
src/                    Game source code
  native-entry.ts       Native runtime entry (draft dev)
  systems/              Game systems (ECS)
  entities/             Entity definitions and prefabs
assets/                 Game assets
  shaders/              Custom WGSL shaders
  models/               3D models (GLTF, PLY, 3DS)
  textures/             Textures (PNG, WebP, KTX2, DDS, HDR)
downdraft.config.json   Engine configuration
```

## Plugins

- **@downdraft/engine/libraries/water** — Gerstner wave simulation, refraction, reflection
- **@downdraft/engine/libraries/physics-rapier** — Rapier physics backend
- **@downdraft/engine/libraries/marching-cubes** — Volumetric deformable terrain
- **@downdraft/engine/libraries/models** — Model loading (GLTF/GLB, PLY, 3DS)
- **@downdraft/engine/modules/devtools** — DevTools panel with scene inspector, GPU debugging

## Engine

Built with [DownDraft Engine](https://github.com/downdraft-engine) — a TypeScript-first game engine on WebGPU — native runtime (Bun + SDL + wgpu).
